  "_doc": "Template roster for linear-autopilot. `bin/harness init` copies it to $AUTOPILOT_CONFIG_DIR/models.json (never edited in the repo). Order inside each pool = preference. 'family' + 'tier' drive upgrades (bin/run-model discover): a newer version of the same family and tier replaces the entry; tiers are never swapped. 'cost' (high|mid|cheap|free) documents what a model costs on the user's plans; 'no_implement' keeps expensive models out of implementation. Accounts: a model entry with 'env' (e.g. CODEX_HOME) is another account of the same CLI (bin/harness add-account). Model ids below are examples from October 2026: run `bin/harness discover` and `bin/run-model discover --apply` after init.",
